---
<section id="book-call" class="py-20 md:py-28 relative">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    
    <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-emerald-500/30 bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-mono font-medium mb-4">
        <span>Available for Q1 / Q2 Sprints</span>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight">
        Book a 15-Minute Architecture Fit Call
      </h3>
      <p class="mt-4 text-slate-300 text-base">
        No sales pitch. Let’s look at your current test suite or compliance deadline, identify your biggest release bottleneck, and decide if our sprint or subscription model is the right fit.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Cal.com Embed Container -->
    <div class="rounded-3xl border border-dark-700 bg-dark-800/80 p-4 sm:p-8 shadow-2xl overflow-hidden min-h-[580px] flex flex-col justify-center items-center text-center">
      
      <!-- Cal.com Embed Code -->
      <!-- Replace 'your-username/15min' with your live Cal.com link once configured -->
      <div class="w-full max-w-xl">
        <p class="text-sm font-mono text-brand-400 mb-6">🗓️ Instant Calendar Booking via Cal.com</p>
        
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-dark-900 border border-dark-700 text-left space-y-4 mb-8">
          <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400 font-mono font-semibold">What We Review in 15 Minutes:</p>
          <ul class="text-sm text-slate-300 space-y-2">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-brand-400 font-mono font-bold">1.</span>
              <span>Your current frontend stack (React, Next.js, Vue) and CI/CD setup</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-brand-400 font-mono font-bold">2.</span>
              <span>Primary bottleneck: Flaky E2E tests vs. WCAG 2.1 AA / VPAT compliance deadlines</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-brand-400 font-mono font-bold">3.</span>
              <span>Scoping whether a 21-Day Sprint or the Monthly Async Retainer makes sense</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <a
          href="https://cal.com/avilano"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 rounded-xl text-base font-bold text-white bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-500 to-indigo-600 hover:from-brand-600 hover:to-indigo-700 shadow-xl shadow-brand-500/25 transition-all hover:scale-[1.02]"
        >
          <span>Open Calendar on Cal.com</span>
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14" /></svg>
        </a>

        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-4">
          Prefer email? Send your repo or questions directly to <a href="mailto:contact@avilano.dev" class="text-brand-400 hover:underline">contact@avilano.dev</a>
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
